      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هوّت بِهِ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَهْوِيتٌ</span>, <i>He called out to
him;</i> (K;) saying <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَوْتَ حَوْتَ</span>: (TA, art.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حيت</span>:) <i>he cried out to him, and called him.</i>
(S.) A dial. form of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هيّت</span>. (TA.) [See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَيَّتَ</span>.]

